<title>USA: Organik to be suspended by Nasdaq.</title>
<headline>Organik to be suspended by Nasdaq.</headline>
<dateline>TACOMA, Wash. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Organik Technologies Inc said trading of its shares will be suspended effective November 11, for failure to meet minimum listing requirements.</p>
<p>The company's shares will continue to trade on the Electronic Bulletin Board under the same symbol.</p>
<p>&quot;It is our intention to return the company to trading status within six months,&quot; Barry Watson, president and chief executive officer, said in a statement.</p>
</text>
